{"1622310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kity Builder", "steam_appid": 1622310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decorate islands and build cute cat cities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kity Builder is a playful city-building sandbox about building settlements and cities for cats! Create beautiful settlements on different-sized and themed islands and watch as ‘kitizens’ move in and make themselves at home. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/f11d160b44851d7f9613e6ddd547abae.poster.avif?t=1750757386\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/f11d160b44851d7f9613e6ddd547abae.webm?t=1750757386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/f11d160b44851d7f9613e6ddd547abae.mp4?t=1750757386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every building is a toy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buildings double as toys to help you further explore the island. Climb, jump, and fling yourself through the air on a quest to discover every hidden nook and cranny. Collect blue(paw)prints and unlock new things to build. And don’t worry, you’re not alone – you’ll have help from Mayor Mewyor, alongside a cast of strange, loveable kitties!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/77cdf417671bda1db2f8bf1ad18147c4.poster.avif?t=1750757386\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/77cdf417671bda1db2f8bf1ad18147c4.webm?t=1750757386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/77cdf417671bda1db2f8bf1ad18147c4.mp4?t=1750757386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No limits. No pressure.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without time limits, resources or even money, Kity Builder is all about the pure fun of creating. Move at your own pace and watch your city grow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/3ff6e5b6a4659e0c7caf10621da104ad.poster.avif?t=1750757386\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/3ff6e5b6a4659e0c7caf10621da104ad.webm?t=1750757386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/3ff6e5b6a4659e0c7caf10621da104ad.mp4?t=1750757386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a city for kitties in an adorable island sandbox!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb, bounce and leap to new heights as you explore the island!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a zany cast of cat-characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create to your heart’s content without timers or restrictions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat puns! Endless, endless cat puns!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decorate islands and build cute cat cities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kity Builder is a playful city-building sandbox about building settlements and cities for cats! Create beautiful settlements on different-sized and themed islands and watch as ‘kitizens’ move in and make themselves at home. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/f11d160b44851d7f9613e6ddd547abae.poster.avif?t=1750757386\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/f11d160b44851d7f9613e6ddd547abae.webm?t=1750757386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/f11d160b44851d7f9613e6ddd547abae.mp4?t=1750757386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every building is a toy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buildings double as toys to help you further explore the island. Climb, jump, and fling yourself through the air on a quest to discover every hidden nook and cranny. Collect blue(paw)prints and unlock new things to build. And don’t worry, you’re not alone – you’ll have help from Mayor Mewyor, alongside a cast of strange, loveable kitties!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/77cdf417671bda1db2f8bf1ad18147c4.poster.avif?t=1750757386\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/77cdf417671bda1db2f8bf1ad18147c4.webm?t=1750757386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/77cdf417671bda1db2f8bf1ad18147c4.mp4?t=1750757386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No limits. No pressure.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without time limits, resources or even money, Kity Builder is all about the pure fun of creating. Move at your own pace and watch your city grow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/3ff6e5b6a4659e0c7caf10621da104ad.poster.avif?t=1750757386\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/3ff6e5b6a4659e0c7caf10621da104ad.webm?t=1750757386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/3ff6e5b6a4659e0c7caf10621da104ad.mp4?t=1750757386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a city for kitties in an adorable island sandbox!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb, bounce and leap to new heights as you explore the island!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a zany cast of cat-characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create to your heart’s content without timers or restrictions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat puns! Endless, endless cat puns!</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Kity Builder is a cozy city-building sandbox mixed with platformer, where you build cute towns for kittens. There’s no time limits or resources to manage, just playful space for your creativity.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Catalan, Galician", "reviews": "“this is a super cute game and everyone should check it out!”<br>ninjamuffin99, co-creator of Friday Night Funkin<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/db8278cfe129d87532d1eda931b72c315cdade9b/header.jpg?t=1750757386", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750757386", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app